{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2022-02-23 07:00:00', 'title': 'BROADRIDGE REPORT SHOWS GLOBAL CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LITIGATION TOPS $3 BILLION, WITH CLAIMS FILING OPPORTUNITIES INCREASING 50% IN 2021', 'text': 'NEW YORK, FEB. 23, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE NUMBER OF GLOBAL CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LITIGATION SETTLEMENTS INCREASED A WHOPPING 50% IN 2021 WITH TOTAL SETTLEMENTS REACHING MORE THAN $3 BILLION, ACCORDING TO THE RECENTLY RELEASED THIRD ANNUAL BROADRIDGE CLASS ACTION REPORT, FROM GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER, BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS , INC. (NYSE: BR). THE REPORT REVEALS SOME SIGNIFICANT TRENDS IN THE CLASS ACTION WORLD THAT ARE ALREADY CONTINUING INTO 2022.'}